{"parse": {"title": "FT-15", "pageid": 55368, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-14\" title=\"FT-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-15</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-16\" title=\"FT-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.9C.BC.E4.B8.AD.E4.B9.8B.E7.89.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"眼中之物\">眼中之物</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 眼中之物</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Don't Look at It</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>嘘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蒙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>眼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>才<span class=\"color-value\"></span>算<span class=\"color-value\"></span>看<span class=\"color-value\"></span>见<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>根据圣洛夫基金会的评估，这将是一次不亚于针对“瓦尔登湖”酒馆的行动，此次的紧急援助评级为A级……我希望你们能提前明白行动的风险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-500202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-500202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-500202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”小队队员Ⅰ：</div><div>可受限于我们的人数与配给……队长，我们没有任何取胜的可能性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-500202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-500202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-500202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”小队队员Ⅰ：</div><div>而且……我们还没有完成调查失踪物资的任务，这难道不正证明我们需要得到更多的帮助吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>不，队员们，这是上面已经制定的作战方针。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>请记住，这不是一次正面作战。鉴于此前的经验，重塑之手各级首领正在四处遁逃、藏匿……我们所需要做的，便是剿首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>这是我们的首要任务，圣洛夫基金会的后续支援只会在我们完成任务后出现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”小队队员Ⅱ：</div><div>换而言之，如果失败……也就只能靠我们自己全身而退，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>犹豫几乎只有一瞬，但所有人都心照不宣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>这不在我们的考虑范围内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>该行动了，队员们……玛蒂尔达调查员发送的坐标位置已经离我们不远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>接下来的路，我们需要步行过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">戴头盔的车手：</div><div>嘿，让开让开！小心点！别站在路中间！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嗡——”摩托车从他们身旁擦肩而过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”小队队员Ⅱ：</div><div>嘿，你们就不会看路吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-510401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>别节外生枝，陶德……该走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛莉安娜太太：</div><div>呵呵，如果蒙上双眼，便可以抚摸那不存在的幻影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛莉安娜太太：</div><div>如果蒙蔽感官，便可寻得日思夜想的去处，呵呵……那么这为何不能称为一种真实呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老妇人摇着襁褓里的“孩子”，轻吻着木枝。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_at_baolina.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_at_baolina\"><img alt=\"2_0_at_baolina\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/Cg-2_0_at_baolina.png/600px-Cg-2_0_at_baolina.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/Cg-2_0_at_baolina.png/900px-Cg-2_0_at_baolina.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/Cg-2_0_at_baolina.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_at_baolina.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仿若一只受伤幼鹿，喘息着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她又成了蜷缩在被窝里的，等待着他关切的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>咳、咳……你并没有来接我，哥哥，你应当在那里等我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>抱歉……抱歉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>别注视幻影！它会令你迷失的，J！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的声音已被隔绝在外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但他比谁都清楚，自己正处于迷失的边缘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我明白你是一个幻影，你只不过是我脑子里的一个挥之不去的念头……但我同样清楚，我为什么想在此驻足……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我一直想问，我一直想问来着……我想得到一个回答——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>告诉我，妹妹，你想过回到海特街吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奄奄一息的女孩点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他走上前，伸出了手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我们可以再一起呆在餐馆里，这一次那些醉汉不会再过来找我们的麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我可以骑上摩托车，带你兜遍旧金山，那些想追你的混小子们都会被我吓得屁滚尿流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>圣洛夫基金会要是再去邀请你，我就让他们好好吃一个闭门羹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她同样伸出了手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>哥哥，这是当然……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“呲！”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_kuanluan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>地上的香炉被干脆地一分为二，幻象飘散而去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他收起了博伊刀，摇摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你不是保利娜，你甚至连她的半个影子都不像。你没有骂我是一个混账，连她面对那些自顾自将她视作弱小的人时，脱口而出的嘲讽，也学不到一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我当然怀念那个以我为傲的妹妹。同时，我比任何人都更清楚，当她收拾行李离开海特街的时候——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>没有任何人比她更以自己为豪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身后的女孩缓了一口气，拍了拍他的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>干得不错，傻大个，玛蒂尔达的小队以你为傲！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>嘿，小家伙，谁认同这个主意了？这个名字明明该叫“J老大”小队！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>……就品味来说，你俩想出的名字不相上下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-625811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-625811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-625811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……你们的嗅觉相当灵敏，先生们，但这无疑是种不幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从阴影中走出，持着一柄手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其他的高个子如影随形，跟在莱格斯身后，围拢了他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>晚上好，各位……尊敬的使徒和环状水星女士，正等候你们的赴宴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>我们不能让他们等太久，你说呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他用枪抵住J的胸口，身后另一位下属冲了上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>这是还给你的，维恩，嗯？还记得我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拳头在J的肚子上结结实实来了一下，连带着搅动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>咳……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>诸位，我们都曾追寻着荒谬的真理抑或欲望，是为一批批愚蠢的羔羊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>我们所臣服的，欺骗我等；我们所希冀的，辜负我等……因此你们来到此处，因此你们皈依“受苦者”的怀抱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>在这庆典之日，作为使徒，我剖自心肺，忏悔我曾执迷的种种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>我来自于一座笃信“万物皆数”的小岛，那里曾是我的短暂的居所，曾是懦弱之我的容身之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>我们自以为远离尘世，自以为可以在洞穴之中，将所有人隔绝于外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他在篝火周围徘徊，信徒们悉数跪拜在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>但当岛外之民屠戮我的同袍，却未见我所信仰的唯一，予我们拯救。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>我目睹死亡肆虐，目睹岛外的人无情地投下炸药，将我昔日的同袍轰炸成泥巴里的一块块肉碎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他手执利剑，划过手心，留下一道深黑的血沟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着抓住J的头发，用血指在他的脖颈上留下一道人为的血迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>呃……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>今非昔比……我找到了真正永恒的居所，“受苦者”给予了我们力量、荣耀……将我们这些子嗣汇聚在一起，而不再受人欺侮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>一个个同袍加入我们，令我们愈发圆满，离“受苦者”的再临，也愈近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在他的身侧，被捆绑住的女孩瞪大了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>那些是……！我、我从来没有亲眼见过……那么多的……面具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>使徒拾起地上的面具，无数人与之相随。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>兄弟姊妹们，请拾起“受苦者”予你们的恩赐，与我吟诵——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>如此欢喜！如此赞美！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>可恶，别那么做——！这些面具会毁了你们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你们只是被眼前的迷雾利诱了，它们并不是真实的，那些都是一时的幻觉……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个个过往，基于血与泪的数据报告浮现于眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:136%\"><b>“重塑之手的面具会以失去神志为代价，<br />帮助佩戴者们度过‘暴雨’。”</b></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张张在面具咒语实验中备受诅咒与折磨的同僚的面容，在脑海中晃过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><b><span style=\"font-size:136%\">“这是残酷而必要的牺牲，<br />为了人类与神秘学家的福祉。”</span></b></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_fusuzhimujitan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304103.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-304103.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304103.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304103.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-304103.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304103.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-304103.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304103.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>停下来，你们……会后悔的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的呐喊贯穿了寂静，却钻不入他们的耳中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们面无表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一块石子落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旋即，洪流倾泻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>如此欢喜！如此赞美！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众信徒：</div><div>如此欢喜！如此赞美！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">使徒米修斯：</div><div>我们惩戒，我们净化，我们唤醒——我们本为一体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众信徒：</div><div>我们惩戒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众信徒：</div><div>我们净化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众信徒：</div><div>我们唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我们唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众信徒：</div><div>我们本为一体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我们本为一体。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-15"}}